{% extends 'layouts/app.twig' %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Laboratório de modelagem</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Desenhe entidades, atributos e relacionamentos arrastando caixas — depois gere o SQL e teste de
            verdade no console. Precisa relembrar a teoria antes? Veja o guia de
            <a href="/guia/modelagem-er" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">Modelagem de dados (MER/DER)</a>.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div
        x-data="erLab({{ diagrams|json_encode }})"
        @pointermove.window="onPointerMove"
        @pointerup.window="onPointerUp"
        class="space-y-4"
    >
        <div class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
                <strong>Nova entidade</strong> cria uma caixa que você arrasta pra qualquer lugar do quadro.
                <strong>Relacionamento</strong> entra num modo de "clique em duas entidades" pra ligar uma na
                outra — clique nos números "1"/"N" perto de cada ponta da linha pra trocar a cardinalidade.
                Clique na PK de um atributo pra marcar ele como chave primária daquela entidade, ou no "⋯" pra
                abrir mais opções desse atributo (não nulo, único, valor padrão, ou marcar como chave
                estrangeira apontando pra outra entidade).
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <button @click="addEntity" type="button" class="btn-primary">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"/>
                    </svg>
                    Nova entidade
                </button>
                <button @click="toggleConnectMode" type="button" class="btn-secondary" :class="connecting && 'ring-2 ring-indigo-400'">
                    <span x-text="connecting ? 'Cancelar relacionamento' : '+ Relacionamento'"></span>
                </button>
                <button @click="openSqlPreview" type="button" class="btn-secondary">Gerar SQL</button>
                <button @click="newDiagram" type="button" class="btn-secondary">Novo diagrama</button>

                <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2">
                    <input
                        type="text" x-model="title" maxlength="80" placeholder="Nome do diagrama"
                        class="field-input w-48 text-sm"
                    >
                    <button :disabled="saving" @click="saveDiagram" type="button" class="btn-primary">
                        <span x-show="!saving">Salvar</span>
                        <span x-show="saving" x-cloak>Salvando…</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p x-show="connecting" x-cloak class="rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-indigo-700">
                <span x-show="!connectFromId">Clique na entidade de origem do relacionamento.</span>
                <span x-show="connectFromId">Agora clique na outra entidade pra conectar (ou clique de novo na mesma pra cancelar).</span>
            </p>

            <div x-show="diagrams.length > 0" x-cloak>
                <h3 class="field-label">Meus diagramas</h3>
                <ul class="mt-1 max-h-40 divide-y divide-slate-100 overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                    <template x-for="diagram in diagrams" :key="diagram.id">
                        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-sm">
                            <button
                                @click="loadDiagram(diagram)" type="button"
                                class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-left font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700"
                                :class="diagram.id === currentDiagramId && 'underline'"
                            >
                                <span x-text="diagram.title"></span>
                                <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">atualizado em <span x-text="diagram.updatedAt"></span></span>
                            </button>
                            <button @click="deleteDiagram(diagram)" type="button" class="shrink-0 text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-red-600">
                                Excluir
                            </button>
                        </li>
                    </template>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div
                x-ref="canvas"
                class="relative h-[560px] overflow-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[radial-gradient(circle,#e2e8f0_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[length:16px_16px]"
            >
                <div x-show="entities.length === 0" x-cloak class="flex h-full items-center justify-center px-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">
                    Quadro vazio — clique em "Nova entidade" pra começar a modelar.
                </div>

                {# Linha "desenhada" com uma <div> fina rotacionada via CSS, não <svg> — <template
                   x-for> dentro de <svg> quebra o escopo do Alpine em elementos SVG (fica sem
                   acesso a `rel`), então fica mais simples e mais confiável assim. #}
                <template x-for="rel in relationships" :key="'linha-' + rel.id">
                    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute h-0.5 origin-top-left bg-slate-400" :style="lineStyle(rel)"></div>
                </template>

                <template x-for="rel in relationships" :key="'ctl-' + rel.id">
                    <div>
                        <div
                            class="absolute flex h-6 w-6 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50"
                            :style="`left:${relPointAt(rel, 0.22).x}px; top:${relPointAt(rel, 0.22).y}px;`"
                            @click="toggleCardinality(rel, 'from')" x-text="rel.cardinalityFrom"
                            title="Cardinalidade do lado da origem — clique pra alternar entre 1 e N"
                        ></div>
                        <div
                            class="absolute flex h-6 w-6 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50"
                            :style="`left:${relPointAt(rel, 0.78).x}px; top:${relPointAt(rel, 0.78).y}px;`"
                            @click="toggleCardinality(rel, 'to')" x-text="rel.cardinalityTo"
                            title="Cardinalidade do lado do destino — clique pra alternar entre 1 e N"
                        ></div>
                        <div
                            class="absolute flex -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-1.5 py-1 shadow-sm"
                            :style="`left:${relPointAt(rel, 0.5).x}px; top:${relPointAt(rel, 0.5).y}px;`"
                        >
                            <input
                                type="text" x-model="rel.label" placeholder="relacionamento"
                                class="w-24 border-0 p-0 text-xs text-slate-600 placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
                            >
                            <button @click="removeRelationship(rel.id)" type="button" class="shrink-0 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-600">✕</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </template>

                <template x-for="entity in entities" :key="entity.id">
                    <div
                        class="absolute rounded-lg border-2 bg-white shadow-sm select-none"
                        :class="connectFromId === entity.id ? 'border-indigo-500' : 'border-slate-300'"
                        :style="`left:${entity.x}px; top:${entity.y}px; width:${ENTITY_WIDTH}px; cursor:` + (connecting ? 'pointer' : 'grab')"
                        @pointerdown="startDrag(entity, $event)"
                    >
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-t-md border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-1.5 pl-0.5 pr-2">
                            <span class="shrink-0 cursor-grab px-1.5 py-1 text-slate-300" title="Arrastar pra reposicionar">⠿</span>
                            {# Sem @pointerdown.stop aqui de propósito: startDrag() já ignora INPUT
                               (não inicia arraste), mas precisa que o clique chegue até ele pra
                               funcionar o modo "conectar" quando a pessoa clica bem no nome. #}
                            <input
                                type="text" x-model="entity.name"
                                class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
                            >
                            <button @click.stop="removeEntity(entity.id)" @pointerdown.stop type="button" class="shrink-0 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-600">✕</button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-1 px-2 py-2">
                            <template x-for="attr in entity.attributes" :key="attr.id">
                                <div @pointerdown.stop>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                                        <button
                                            @click="setPrimaryKey(entity, attr.id)" type="button"
                                            class="shrink-0 rounded px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold"
                                            :class="attr.pk ? 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-700' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-200'"
                                            title="Marcar como chave primária"
                                        >PK</button>
                                        <input
                                            type="text" x-model="attr.name" placeholder="atributo"
                                            class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-xs text-slate-700 placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
                                        >
                                        <select
                                            x-show="!attr.pk" x-cloak x-model="attr.type"
                                            class="shrink-0 border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-[10px] text-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
                                        >
                                            <template x-for="type in attributeTypes" :key="type">
                                                <option :value="type" x-text="type"></option>
                                            </template>
                                        </select>
                                        <button
                                            x-show="!attr.pk" x-cloak @click="attr.expanded = !attr.expanded" type="button"
                                            class="shrink-0" :class="attr.expanded ? 'text-indigo-600' : 'text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600'"
                                            title="Mais opções: não nulo, único, padrão, chave estrangeira"
                                        >⋯</button>
                                        <button @click="removeAttribute(entity, attr.id)" type="button" class="shrink-0 text-slate-300 hover:text-red-600">✕</button>
                                    </div>

                                    <div x-show="attr.expanded && !attr.pk" x-cloak x-transition class="ml-5 mt-1 space-y-1.5 rounded-md bg-slate-50 p-1.5">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                            <label class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-slate-600">
                                                <input type="checkbox" x-model="attr.notNull" class="h-3 w-3 rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-400">
                                                não nulo
                                            </label>
                                            <label class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-slate-600">
                                                <input type="checkbox" x-model="attr.unique" class="h-3 w-3 rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-400">
                                                único
                                            </label>
                                        </div>
                                        <input
                                            type="text" x-model="attr.default" placeholder="valor padrão (opcional)"
                                            class="w-full rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white px-1.5 py-1 text-[10px] text-slate-700 placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-200"
                                        >
                                        <select
                                            x-model="attr.fkEntityId"
                                            class="w-full rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white px-1.5 py-1 text-[10px] text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-200"
                                        >
                                            <option value="">— não é chave estrangeira —</option>
                                            <template x-for="other in entities" :key="other.id">
                                                <option :value="other.id" x-text="'FK → ' + (other.name || '(sem nome)')"></option>
                                            </template>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </template>
                        </div>

                        <button
                            @click="addAttribute(entity)" @pointerdown.stop type="button"
                            class="w-full border-t border-slate-100 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-indigo-600"
                        >+ atributo</button>
                    </div>
                </template>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            x-show="showSqlModal" x-cloak
            class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900/50 p-4"
            x-transition.opacity.duration.150ms
        >
            <div
                x-show="showSqlModal"
                x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-150"
                x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 scale-95"
                x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 scale-100"
                @click.outside="showSqlModal = false"
                @keydown.escape.window="showSqlModal = false"
                class="w-full max-w-2xl rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-xl"
            >
                <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">SQL gerado a partir do diagrama</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
                    Confira antes de rodar — é uma tradução automática, não um substituto pra revisar o modelo.
                </p>
                <pre class="mt-4 max-h-96 overflow-auto rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-100" x-text="generatedSql"></pre>
                <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:justify-end">
                    <button type="button" @click="showSqlModal = false" class="btn-secondary">Fechar</button>
                    <button type="button" @click="copySql" class="btn-secondary">Copiar</button>
                    <button type="button" @click="openInConsole" class="btn-primary">Abrir no console SQL →</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
